<title>CHILE: Entel Chile Q1 net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Entel Chile Q1 net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Entel Chile SA reported the following results in the first quarter of the year.</p>
<p>		  Q1 1997	    Q1 1996</p>
<p>Net profit    6.15	profit   2.96</p>
<p>Oper profit   7.55	profit   6.26</p>
<p>Non-oper loss 0.59	loss     3.25</p>
<p>Revenues	37.38		 34.62</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of Chilean pesos. ((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595 x212))</p>
</text>
